WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.534
Yesterday your child heard that two words start the same. Today they say that first sound alone.

2
00:00:05.984 --> 00:00:12.796
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:13.296 --> 00:00:15.875
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:18.455
Say the name of every picture first.

5
00:00:18.905 --> 00:00:22.301
Then say the first word, and after it, only how it starts.

6
00:00:22.751 --> 00:00:23.766
The word is map.

7
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:26.537
The word is sun.

8
00:00:28.193 --> 00:00:29.241
The word is leg.

9
00:00:31.047 --> 00:00:35.659
Each one is the sound, not the name of the letter. And nothing is added on the end.

10
00:00:36.109 --> 00:00:40.635
Some sounds cannot be held. Say those twice, softly. Like the start of pig.

11
00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:47.740
Your child says the first sound of the six pictures in job one, and marks each box.

12
00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:55.312
In job two, each box has four pictures. Three start the same. Your child crosses out the one that does not.

13
00:00:55.762 --> 00:00:58.280
Then they turn the page around and check the answers.

14
00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:02.324
At the end, your child says the first sound of three pictures for you.
